    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know about \"learning and growing\"... that feels like something people say to make themselves feel better. the fact is i'm a coward. i think some people are just born with this darkness in them. there's no fixing that. i look at people who are actually good and kind, and i just feel like i'm taking up space that better people should have. like i'm just a drain on everything around me.",
